            <svg class="chevron" viewBox="0 0 16 16" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
              <path d="M3.25 5.75 8 10.25l4.75-4.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.75"></path>
            </svg>
          </button>
        </h2>
        <div class="details" id="answer-sleep">
          <p>Most adult cats sleep between 12 and 16 hours a day, and kittens or senior cats may sleep even more.</p>
          <p>They are crepuscular, so they are usually more active around dawn and dusk than in the middle of the day.</p>
        </div>
