            <svg class="chevron" viewBox="0 0 16 16" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
              <path d="M3.25 5.75 8 10.25l4.75-4.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.75"></path>
            </svg>
          </button>
        </h2>
        <div class="details" id="answer-water">
          <p>Some cats prefer moving water, cooler water, or bowls placed away from food. Wide bowls can also feel better because they do not press on sensitive whiskers.</p>
          <p>A pet fountain or a second water station in another room often helps improve hydration.</p>
        </div>
