            </svg>
          </button>
        </h2>
        <div class="details" id="answer-knead">
          <p>Kneading is a kitten behavior linked to nursing, and many adult cats keep doing it because it feels soothing and familiar.</p>
          <p>It can also be a way for cats to mark a favorite resting spot using scent glands in their paws.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

